Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: Implement IXMLDOMElement::normalize.

Adjacent text nodes become one, in the elements below too; CDATA sections
stay apart and empty text nodes stay, as on Windows 11.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

